{"k":"treq","t":"Trigonometric Equations","cls":"11","u":"Trigonometry","s":[["General solutions",[{"q":"General solution of $\\sin\\theta=\\sin\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=n\\pi+(-1)^n\\alpha,\\quad n\\in\\mathbb Z"},{"q":"General solution of $\\cos\\theta=\\cos\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=2n\\pi\\pm\\alpha"},{"q":"General solution of $\\tan\\theta=\\tan\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=n\\pi+\\alpha"},{"q":"Squared forms","f":"\\sin^2\\theta=\\sin^2\\alpha,\\ \\cos^2\\theta=\\cos^2\\alpha,\\ \\tan^2\\theta=\\tan^2\\alpha\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\theta=n\\pi\\pm\\alpha"},{"q":"Zeros and special values","f":"\\sin\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=n\\pi;\\quad\\cos\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=(2n+1)\\tfrac\\pi2;\\quad\\tan\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=n\\pi","n":"$\\sin\\theta=1\\Rightarrow\\theta=2n\\pi+\\frac\\pi2$; $\\cos\\theta=1\\Rightarrow2n\\pi$; $\\cos\\theta=-1\\Rightarrow(2n+1)\\pi$."},{"q":"Simultaneous equations ($\\sin\\theta=\\sin\\alpha$, $\\cos\\theta=\\cos\\alpha$)","f":"\\theta=2n\\pi+\\alpha","n":"Find $\\alpha$ in $[0,2\\pi)$ satisfying both, then add $2n\\pi$."},{"q":"$\\sin\\theta=k$ written with principal value","f":"\\theta=n\\pi+(-1)^n\\sin^{-1}k,\\quad|k|\\le1"},{"q":"$\\cos\\theta=k$ and $\\tan\\theta=k$ with principal value","f":"\\theta=2n\\pi\\pm\\cos^{-1}k\\ (|k|\\le1);\\qquad\\theta=n\\pi+\\tan^{-1}k"},{"q":"$\\sin\\theta=\\cos\\alpha$ type","f":"\\sin\\theta=\\cos\\alpha\\Rightarrow\\theta=n\\pi+(-1)^n\\left(\\tfrac\\pi2-\\alpha\\right)"},{"q":"$\\sin\\theta=-1$, $\\cos\\theta=0$ style special cases","f":"\\sin\\theta=-1\\Rightarrow\\theta=2n\\pi-\\tfrac\\pi2;\\qquad\\tan\\theta\\ \\text{undefined}\\Rightarrow\\theta=(2n+1)\\tfrac\\pi2"},{"q":"$\\sin A=\\sin B$ and $\\cos A=\\cos B$ in difference form","f":"\\sin A=\\sin B\\iff\\sin\\tfrac{A-B}2\\cos\\tfrac{A+B}2=0;\\qquad\\cos A=\\cos B\\iff\\sin\\tfrac{A+B}2\\sin\\tfrac{A-B}2=0"}]],["Standard forms",[{"q":"$a\\cos\\theta+b\\sin\\theta=c$","f":"\\cos(\\theta-\\phi)=\\frac c{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}},\\ \\tan\\phi=\\frac ba;\\qquad\\text{solvable iff } |c|\\le\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}"},{"q":"Equations in $\\sin x\\pm\\cos x$ and $\\sin x\\cos x$","f":"t=\\sin x+\\cos x\\Rightarrow\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{t^2-1}2,\\ \\ t\\in[-\\sqrt2,\\sqrt2]"},{"q":"Equations reducible by $\\tan\\frac\\theta2$","f":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2},\\quad\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2},\\quad t=\\tan\\tfrac\\theta2","n":"Check $\\theta=(2n+1)\\pi$ separately (lost when substituting)."},{"q":"Homogeneous equations in $\\sin$ and $\\cos$","f":"a\\sin^2x+b\\sin x\\cos x+c\\cos^2x=0:\\ \\text{divide by }\\cos^2x\\to a\\tan^2x+b\\tan x+c=0","n":"Check $\\cos x=0$ separately when $a=0$."},{"q":"Equations of the form $\\sin mx=\\sin nx$","f":"mx=k\\pi+(-1)^knx"},{"q":"Sum-to-product method","f":"\\sin x+\\sin3x+\\sin5x=0\\to\\text{pair outer terms: } 2\\sin3x\\cos2x+\\sin3x=0"},{"q":"Equations with $\\sin x\\cos x$ product chains","f":"\\text{multiply by } 2\\sin x \\text{ repeatedly: } 8\\sin x\\cos x\\cos2x\\cos4x=\\sin8x"},{"q":"Solving using $t=\\sin x-\\cos x$","f":"\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{1-t^2}2,\\ t\\in[-\\sqrt2,\\sqrt2]"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Things to check when solving","f":"\\text{domain},\\ \\text{extraneous roots from squaring},\\ \\text{division by a zero factor}"},{"q":"Number of solutions by graph","f":"\\#\\text{solutions of } f(x)=g(x)=\\#\\text{intersections of } y=f(x),\\ y=g(x)"},{"q":"Equations with boundedness","f":"\\sin^m x+\\cos^n x=1\\ \\text{or}\\ \\sin x\\cdot\\sin y=1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\text{each factor at its extreme}","n":"E.g. $\\sin x+\\sin y=2\\Rightarrow\\sin x=\\sin y=1$."},{"q":"Principal solutions","f":"\\text{solutions in } [0,2\\pi)"},{"q":"Number of solutions in an interval","f":"\\text{list the general solution and count } n \\text{ giving values in the interval}"},{"q":"Inequalities $\\sin x>k$","f":"\\sin x>k\\ (|k|<1):\\ x\\in(2n\\pi+\\alpha,\\ 2n\\pi+\\pi-\\alpha),\\ \\alpha=\\sin^{-1}k"},{"q":"Inequalities $\\cos x>k$ and $\\tan x>k$","f":"\\cos x>k:\\ x\\in(2n\\pi-\\beta,\\ 2n\\pi+\\beta),\\ \\beta=\\cos^{-1}k;\\qquad\\tan x>k:\\ x\\in(n\\pi+\\gamma,\\ n\\pi+\\tfrac\\pi2)"},{"q":"Equations with $\\sin^{2n}$ and bounds","f":"\\sin^{2}x+\\cos^{4}x\\ \\ldots\\ \\text{use } 0\\le\\sin^2x\\le1\\ \\text{and compare extreme values}"},{"q":"Solving $a\\sin x+b\\cos x=c$ in an interval","f":"\\text{number of solutions in } [0,2\\pi):\\ 2\\ (|c|<R),\\ 1\\ (|c|=R),\\ 0\\ (|c|>R),\\ R=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}"},{"q":"Equations involving $|\\sin x|$ etc.","f":"|\\sin x|=\\sin x\\iff\\sin x\\ge0;\\ \\text{split by quadrant}"}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If it asks the number of solutions in an interval","f":"\\text{reduce to } \\sin x=k,\\ \\cos x=k,\\ \\tan x=k;\\ \\text{count over the interval (or by graphs)}","n":"Use the general solution and list $n$; or sketch both sides and count intersections. Exclude points where the original is undefined.","p":"8 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 40 times"},{"q":"If a parameter must make the equation solvable","f":"\\cos2x+a\\sin x=\\ldots\\Rightarrow\\text{quadratic in } t=\\sin x,\\ t\\in[-1,1]\\ \\text{must have a root}","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 7 times"},{"q":"If $a\\cos\\theta+b\\sin\\theta=c$ in a restricted interval","f":"\\text{square carefully or use } \\cos(\\theta-\\phi)=\\frac c{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}};\\ \\text{pick the root in range}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 3 times"},{"q":"If $\\log_{\\cos x}$ or exponents with $\\sin^2x$","f":"\\log_{\\cos x}\\cot x=\\frac{\\ln\\cot x}{\\ln\\cos x};\\ \\ 81^{\\sin^2x}+81^{\\cos^2x}=30\\Rightarrow t+\\tfrac{81}t=30","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 6 times"},{"q":"If a trig inequality is asked","f":"\\text{solve the equality, then test signs between consecutive roots}","p":"1 PYQ (2019–2026) · asked 1 time"}]]]}